  "job_B16.15_20251003_114352": {
    "text": "Sergius papa, Godes \u00feeowa \u00feeow, Aldhelme abbode \u00e6t Mealdumesbyrig & his \u00e6fterfylgendum.\n& \u00feurh eow eowrum arwyr\u00f0um mynstre \u00e6w fulre drohtnunge munecum, godes \u00feeowum.\n\u00dea \u00feincg \u00fee \u00f0ar synd tobrohte & togyfene for frigre are & \u00e6hte to libbenne, na for lu\u00f0re gel\u00e6fednesse.\nAc for geornfulnesse wel to drohtnienne.\n\u00deeowdomum hi sylfe \u00fea munecas n\u00e6dsyndrige gewissunge to \u00feeowigienne.\nButon \u00e6lcum twyn beon hi generude fram bisceopum & Godes biggencgerum.\n\u00dea \u00f0e Godes butan alysede fram bende \u00e6lces mennissces domes eallicre his.\nFram \u00e6lcere g\u00e6rsuman woruldlicra brucunga gewor\u00f0ene cl\u00e6ne & unm\u00e6ne.\nEall swa hyra munuc behat & hyra regol him cy\u00fe.\n\u00de hi Gode hi sylfe ge\u00e6mtigean.\n& his sylfes \u00feeowdome beon atihte.\nFor \u00fe\u00e6s mycelan m\u00e6gan \u00ferymmes arwyr\u00fenysse hi synd gefreode.\nNa \u00fe an woruldlicra doma hefitemum byr\u00feenum.\nAc eac swylce beon hi wyr\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6stan wyr\u00fescipes for \u00fe\u00e6re rihtre regules lufan.\n\u00deanon eower eadmodnyss & eower \u00e6wf\u00e6stnyss us bitt \u00fe we scylon getrymman mid apostolicum sunder\nOn \u00feam m\u00e6ran gemynde gelogud \u00e6t Meldum, \u00fe is o\u00ferum naman Maldumes buruh geclypud, gesett &\n& eac o\u00feer mynster is ar\u00e6red on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan scire.\nWi\u00fe \u00fea ea \u00feeo is geclypud Fron.\nOn wyr\u00fescipe \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran fulluhteres Iohannis is.\n\u00deis we do\u00fe for ure ealdres lufe sancte Petres \u00fea.\n& ure alysend h\u00e6lend Crist gemedemude be.\nTo gewri\u00feenne & to unbindenne on heofenan.\n\u00d0enunge & ciricean we eac bruca\u00fe & Gode.\nGendum geendebyrda\u00fe & dihta\u00fe \u00feeah \u00fee we unwyr\u00fee & ungelice synd.\nBe \u00feisum forespecenum cyricum we habba\u00fe.\nManegra so\u00fera race gehyred \u00fee to us.\n\u00d0u him.\nFore gleawlice & wislice wissudest & dihtest.\n\u00de\u00e6s wel u\u00feon eowre est fulre eadmodnysse, to eowrum fultume.\nWe mynegia\u00fe eow gebro\u00feru & halsia\u00fe \u00fe ge beon on Godes lofu carfulle.\n& on gebedum \u00feurh wacule.\nOn forh\u00e6fednysse & on cl\u00e6nnysse f\u00e6sthafule & on clyfigende.\nCumli\u00fenysse & manscipes wel d\u00e6dum beon under\u00feeodde.\nHyrsumnysse & Cristes eadmodnysse \u00feurh wunian \u00e6fre lufigendras & eow eall abutan mid \u00fe\u00e6re\n& \u00fe\u00e6s apostolices geleafan rihtincge ungewemmedlice gehealdan.\nGodum biggencgum simble to ge\u00e6mtigean.\nManscipe gyfan be \u00feearfendum & \u00e6l \u00feeodigum.\nGodes cyricena bisceopum & m\u00e6sse preostum arwyr\u00f0nysse gegearwian swa hi hit geearnian.\nGode \u00e6fre ge\u00e6mtigean, gemedemunge & \u00feearflicnysse lufian.\nOn sealmum & on gastlicum ymnum & on singalum gebedum, on eallum Godes bebodum eow\n& huru on eornust \u00fe ge beon carfulle embe eowre saule \u00feearfe.\n& simble truwian on Godes fultum eow sylfe ungewemmede \u00fe cl\u00e6nnyss & sidefulnys eowres lichaman\n\u00de se inra mann \u00fe is seo saul sie mid mihte Godes gyfe & eac se uttra \u00fe is se lichama begyte lof goddre\nWe gedema\u00fe & gesetta\u00fe mid andweardum apostolicum.\nSunderfreodomum beon to bewerigende &.\n\u00deas fore s\u00e6dan & arwyr\u00fean mynstru for\u00fei \u00fee.\nNa\u00f0 & beon sceal ure bisceoplicre gyfe wel d\u00e6d \u00feylcum Godes freondum \u00fee hi \u00feus healda\u00fe swa we\n\u00de hi under rihtum dome & bewerunge \u00feas sylfan \u00fee we \u00feeowia\u00f0 ures aldres \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan petres\nNa hi n\u00e6fre na gyrnan nanne o\u00f0\u00f0e bisceopa o\u00fe\u00fee sacerda.\nO\u00fe\u00fee \u00e6nigra cyriclicre endebyrdnysse preost.\nNa hi huru \u00feinga na gesetten nanne bisceopstol innon hyra cyricean o\u00f0\u00f0e fur\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6r l\u00e6tan \u00fe\u00e6ne\nGyf \u00fe getimie \u00fe is eallum mannum gem\u00e6re \u00fe se abbud gewite of \u00feissum life & hit cume \u00fe\u00e6rto \u00fe hi\n\u00de \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00fee hi ceosa\u00f0 of godes \u00feeowum si \u00fe stede f\u00e6st \u00fe nan lyre o\u00f0\u00f0e.\nAcume on \u00fea lare \u00fe\u00e6re munuclicre drohtnunge.\n\u00deincg forwyr\u00fean for abbudleaste.\nSe bisceop.\nNe awiste beo be ure apostolicre leafe & ealdordome nime.\nR\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6rto \u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r abbud wyr\u00fee.\nNu ge gebro\u00f0ru.\n\u00deincg synd \u00feus gelogud.\nGyf \u00e6nig bisceop si o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6sse preost o\u00fe\u00fee \u00e6niges gehadudes o\u00fe\u00fee l\u00e6wedes na si he na swa rice \u00fe se\nWite he hine scyldigne \u00e6tforan godes gesih\u00fee & fram ascyrudne fram gem\u00e6nnysse \u00fe\u00e6s halwendes\nSi he gedemed eall swa w\u00e6s Annanias & Zafira his wif fram sancte petre \u00fe\u00e6s apostol.\nE & si he to bealue & to ecere yrm\u00fee efre geteald & bet\u00e6ht, buton he hit er h\u00e6le & bete.\nSi \u00e6fre lif & h\u00e6l & ece eadignyss \u00feam \u00fee \u00feas \u00f0incg gehealdan & \u00feam \u00fee hi beo to healdenne.\nHand tacen \u00e6\u00feelredes Myrcena kyncges.\nHand tacen Ines Wessexena cyncges.\nIc Ealdhelm brohte to Ine Wessexena kyncge & to \u00c6\u00feelr\u00e6de Myrcena kyncge \u00feas privilegia.\n\u00de sind syndrie freodomas \u00fee se apostolica papa Sergius awrat to \u00f0\u00e6ra apostola mynstre Petres &\n& hi ge\u00few\u00e6redon & hi hit swa geendudon, \u00fe swa hwe\u00feer swa hit w\u00e6re swa sibb swa twyrednys\n\u00de \u00fe\u00e6t mynster beo \u00e6fre on sibbe & \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r Gode \u00f0eowia\u00f0.",
